# Arche source ends its lines with '\n' (spec/arche.md 2.1), the shell
# scripts here are run by sh, and the bootstrap compares bytes: every text
# file of this repository is LF in the working tree too, Windows included
# (docs/sprints.md S19). Without this, a checkout with core.autocrlf would
# give the compiler its own source with '\r' in it.
* text=auto eol=lf
